<title>USA: IMP names new president/CEO.</title>
<headline>IMP names new president/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>IMP Inc said Tuesday it has named Phil Ferguson president, chief executive and a member of its board of directors.</p>
<p>He succeeds David Laws, who has been named chairman.</p>
<p>Most recently, Ferguson has been principal of Ferguson Associates, providing domestic and international high-technology consulting services.</p>
<p>IMP is a supplier of analog and high-voltage wafer foundry services and standard analog integrated circuits for computer, communications and control applications.</p>
<p>(-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610)</p>
</text>
